{
  "voice": "成人男声｜老师清晰",
  "reference": "/Users/zhaozixu/Documents/Codex/2026-06-04/new-chat/work/full_voice_catalog/12-adult-male-teacher-clear.wav",
  "cfg_value": 1.35,
  "inference_timesteps": 12,
  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Last year I had a trip with my friend Nancy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "We enjoyed sandwiches and shared a jar of honey tea over lunch.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The weather was cloudy except for one night.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wearing comfortable skirts, Nancy and I camped in the field after dinner.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "I listened to her playing the guitar and we felt relaxed.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Looking at the stars, we started a hunt for the brightest one.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "'It's a pity we don't know which stars we're looking at, Jenny,' said Nancy.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "'I know some of them,' I answered.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Nancy felt surprised when I finally finished telling her all the names I knew.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "My interest in stars began when I was eight.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "My aunt Mrs Hill took me to a planetarium.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "A guide showed us the groups of stars, and told us stories about how they got their names.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "The stories were wonderful.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "I even saw some x-ray images of the stars there.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "It felt like standing in front of the gate of knowledge.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "I took a course at the club to learn more about stars.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "I realised that in addition to clouds, a bright moon also stops us seeing stars clearly.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-17.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "I always look for the Plough, because once I see that, I can find the North Star and other stars.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-18.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "There are so many lights in the city, that we have to go into the countryside to see any stars.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-19.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "I'm planning to make videos about stars in the countryside.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-20.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "I'll post them online for everyone to watch.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-21.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "My greatest dream is to be an astronaut and I wish I could have a space travel.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-22.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
